Output assets/lgtm-run.gif

Require lgtm
Require codex

Set Shell "zsh"
Set Theme "TokyoNight"
Set FontSize 24
Set Width 1100
Set Height 1240
Set Padding 18
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Hide
Type "unset NO_COLOR; export FORCE_COLOR=1; clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show

Type "lgtm run --root=../smpl"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 24s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1200ms
